me/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/paper_framing.md`\n\nD013 claim (Claim 2): Format homogenization is NOT caused by curation. Same-K comparison shows identical degradation under curated and random selection. Higher K amplifies severity.\n\n### 3. **Detailed Metrics for Empty-Registry Experiments**\n\n**carr_quick_probe_k8_02 metrics:**\nLocated in `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/logs/workers/worker_analysis_carr_quick_probe_k8_02_20260516T195526_result.json`\n\n| Metric | Gen0 | Gen1 | Gen2 | Vendi Change |\n|--------|------|------|------|--------------|\n| mean_quality | 0.1146 | 0.1136 | 0.1143 | -0.26% |\n| vendi_score | 107.21 | 107.26 | 107.25 | **-0.03%** (P1 FAIL) |\n| self_bleu | 0.0057 | 0.0024 | 0.0064 | +12.3% |\n| perplexity | 9.40 | 9.18 | 10.20 | +8.5% |\n| mean_nn_distance | 0.7097 | 0.7086 | 0.7095 | +0.0% |\n\n**carr_fullft_lr2e5_probe_01 metrics:**\nLocated in `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/artifacts/carr_fullft_lr2e5_probe_01_metrics.json`\n\n| Metric | Gen0 | Gen1 | Gen2 | Vendi Change |\n|--------|------|------|------|--------------|\n| mean_quality | 0.1130 | 0.1154 | 0.1124 | -0.53% |\n| vendi_score | 107.81 | 108.03 | 108.54 | **+0.68%** (inverse of expected) |\n| self_bleu | 0.0046 | 0.0039 | 0.0040 | -13.0% |\n| perplexity | 9.57 | 10.34 | 8.82 | -7.8% |\n| mean_nn_distance | 0.7079 | 0.7107 | 0.7100 | +0.30% |\n\n### 4. **Tier Definition System**\n\n**Location:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/.claude/sessions/paper_agent_b78e9e93/CLAUDE.md` and paper_provenance.yaml\n\nThe project uses a **3-tier evidence classification system**:\n- **Tier 1**: Direct experimental evidence from registry\n- **Tier 2**: Supporting/contextual evidence (references, setup parameters)\n- **Tier 3**: No evidence (requires citation or theoretical justification)\n\n**Trigger condition**: Tier 3 > 30% of claims → must report to Director\n\nCurrent project status (from `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/paper_provenance.yaml`):\n- tier1: 0\n- tier2: 39\n- tier3: 3\n\n### 5. **Scenario/Condition Definitions**\n\n**Primary definition source:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/artifacts/experiment_data_table.md`\n\nTwo condition tiers:\n\n**A. Reward-Curated Conditions (ArmoRM top-1-of-K):**\n- LoRA, K=4 | LoRA, K=8 | Full-FT K=4 (lr=5e-6) | Full-FT K=4 (lr=2e-5)\n\n**B. No-Curation Baselines (random 1-of-K):**\n- LoRA K=4 random | Full-FT K=4 random\n\nAll conditions: 2000 train prompts + 200 eval prompts, 3 generations, Qwen3-0.6B model, ArmoRM-Llama3-8B-v0.1 scoring\n\n### 6. **Additional Analysis Files**\n\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/artifacts/analysis_carr_fullft_lr2e5_nocuration_01.md` - No-curation full-FT baseline analysis\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/artifacts/k16_probe_analysis.md` - K=16 extreme selection pressure test (Vendi change: -0.19%, P1 FAIL)\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/artifacts/collapse_signal_summary.md` - Summary of format/template collapse signals\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/artifacts/experiment_data_table.md` - Complete experiment summary across all 8 configurations with training loss details\n\nAll format metrics confirm the D013 finding: **format collapse is inherent to iterative training (not curation), and higher K values amplify the severity**."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"419c6fbb-223f-48ac-bd98-ee4399849d25","uuid":"5187f72c-31ac-49ea-9335-865f8e471f81","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:01:58.152Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In the project at /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse